# Files that must never enter a container image.
#
# Without this, `COPY . /app` pulls in every video in inbox/ and every result
# in output/ -- gigabytes of data that make the build slow and the image
# enormous, for no benefit. The tests generate their own tiny clip instead.
#
# Podman reads this file; Docker reads .dockerignore, which is a symlink to it
# (or a copy on Windows).

# Your media and results.
inbox/*
!inbox/.gitkeep
!inbox/README.txt
output/*
!output/.gitkeep
!output/README.txt
output_test/

# Anything left from a local run.
*.mp4
*.mkv
*.mov
*.avi
*.webm
*.mp3
*.wav
*.jpg

# Python build artefacts and environments.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Local settings, which may hold API keys.
.env

# Version control and editors.
.git/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Agent and tooling folders.
.claude/
